{"name":"The FunctionDef Bell","slug":"glyph-functiondef-bell","blurb":"On the transform street, Quin carries the bell toward the bracket lamp. The mark is FunctionDef. Click the bell and it lights. A touch does not keep a step. A step away from the lamp is not kept. A step is kept only when the gap shrinks. The page proves its own street law on load. Glyph: The FunctionDef Bell.","seal":"84cc3a2b2f328e98db9d99095b4525a05026dd89ffb8b6e6125ca601f7ac23de"}
